I look at the laptop.
My mother and my father smile.
But there is a person in the background.
The picture is blurry.
I ask, "Who is that?"
My mother turns around.
The person comes closer.
It is a man.
"Good morning, Maya!" says the man.
It is my brother Diego.
"Hello Diego!" I say.
Then I see another person.
A girl comes into the picture.
It is my sister.
"Hello Sofia!" I call out.
Sofia waves and smiles.
My family is together.
I am very happy.
